flowchart LR
    U[Operator in browser] --> UI[Pactline Control Center<br/>React + Vite<br/>localhost:5173]
    UI -->|POST /api/run start| PROXY[Vite API proxy]
    PROXY --> API[Pactline API<br/>Express bridge<br/>127.0.0.1:8787]
    API --> VALIDATE[Validation + rate limit<br/>origin + operator auth]
    VALIDATE --> ORCH[Run orchestrator<br/>api/run.mjs]
    ORCH --> INVOICE[Invoice tools<br/>read + extract + write]
    INVOICE --> STORE[(Durable JSON store<br/>runs, invoices, audit,<br/>settings, outbox)]
    ORCH --> SDKADAPTER[ArmorIQ live adapter]
    SDKADAPTER --> SDK[ArmorIQ SDK v0.6.10<br/>ArmorIQClient]
    SDK -->|capturePlan + getIntentToken| INTENT[Cryptographically bound<br/>intent token / plan]
    SDK -->|invoke MCP action + token| MCP[Registered MCP server<br/>pactline-invoice]
    MCP --> TOOLS[Four tools:<br/>read_invoice<br/>extract_fields<br/>write_record<br/>send_email]
    TOOLS --> STORE
    MCP --> DECIDE{Inside captured<br/>intent and policy?}
    DECIDE -->|allow| CONTINUE[Continue autonomous execution]
    DECIDE -->|hold| HOLD[Return held action<br/>before side effect]
    HOLD --> UI
    UI -->|POST /api/run decide| API
    API --> HUMAN{Human decision}
    HUMAN -->|reject| REJECT[Persist rejection<br/>outbox remains empty]
    HUMAN -->|approve| REAUTHORIZE[Invoke approved recipient<br/>through ArmorIQ SDK again]
    REAUTHORIZE --> EFFECT[Controlled test outbox effect]
    REJECT --> STORE
    EFFECT --> STORE
    STORE -->|GET /api/run| API
    API --> UI

